Take notes and to-dos in Markdown and sync them with end-to-end encryption

Joplin is a note-taking and to-do app that handles large collections of notes organised into notebooks. Notes are written in Markdown, can be tagged and searched, and stay on your device so they are available offline.

- Import notes from Evernote, including attachments and metadata
- End-to-end encrypted sync with Nextcloud, Dropbox, OneDrive and Joplin Cloud
- Full-text search across all notes
- Plugins and themes
- Edit notes in your own text editor
